  "description": "ModernTrackBar.WinForms is a modern, customizable TrackBar and Slider control for C# Windows Forms applications. It provides smooth GDI+ rendering, gradient tracks, dynamic value display, hover feedback, built-in themes, and custom styling. Designed as a modern alternative to the standard WinForms TrackBar for .NET Framework 4.7.2, .NET Framework 4.8, .NET 6 Windows, and .NET 8 Windows desktop applications.",
